  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Stream-CAM: \nPlease add a toggle to hide the CAM-UI ingame when streaming\n \nIts constantly in the way, no matter where you try to \"park\" it out of sight (eg: while dancing)\nWhen it is shown in your POV ingame it degrades fps - noticably! ...and exactly this (unnecessary) loss of frames  could be the drop forcing you & thus your stream into laggy reprojection... 😐\n\nEdit: Looks \"funny\" when you park the StreamCAM-UI above (video) or below (butt-pic) you and you look at/interact with it... still it affects your fps negatively, so does parking it behind you\n\nVRClens has an option for this, also a casting-mode for streams (but vrclens really feels like overkill, now that VRCs ingame-CAM got most of its features aswell...) \n\nVideo: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/337673877553545229/1046480415386517615",
